👉 Enum ek special class hoti hai jisme fixed values store hoti hain.

  from enum import Enum
  
  class Status(Enum):
      APPROVED = 1
      PENDING = 2
      REJECTED = 3
  
  status = Status.APPROVED
  
  if status == Status.APPROVED:
      print("Admission Done")

👉 Enums improve code readability by replacing magic values with meaningful names.

